       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-WIFI-TELEM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WIFI-TELEM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PACKET-OK                PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ADC-VOLTAGE-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAIL-STABILITY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TELEMETRY-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TELEMETRY-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-WIFI-TELEM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PTM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PTM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PACKET-AND-ADC.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RAIL-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PACKET-AND-ADC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PACKET-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ADC-VOLTAGE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RAIL-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAIL-STABILITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TELEMETRY-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PACKET-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ADC-VOLTAGE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RAIL-STABILITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TELEMETRY-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TELEMETRY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PTM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PTM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PTM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PTM-CODE.
